                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The overall dining atmosphere and the speed of food service were excellent.\n\nIf tea and wet wipes were provided with the meal, it would be even better!\n\nIf we wanted to take away leftovers, providing cutlery and napkins would be even better!\n\nIt\u0027s a real shame that the takeout bag didn\u0027t have the restaurant\u0027s name, phone number, or address printed on it.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "整體用餐氛圍 上菜速度很優質\n\n如若：\n用餐有附茶水跟濕紙巾的話\n更加分～\n\n吃不完外帶，有附餐具🍴紙巾的話\n更加分～\n\n外帶的提袋沒有印上餐廳名稱、電話地址\n真是太可惜了",
